/**
 * Public URL map for the MUQABIL single-page app.
 *
 * Each top-level section is addressable at its own path so search engines can
 * discover and index it (see public/sitemap.xml, generated by
 * scripts/generate-sitemap.ts). AppContext uses these helpers to keep the
 * address bar, the browser history and the active section in sync.
 */

